{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule sync_wedge #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2\n)(\n    input  clk_i,\n    input  rst_ni,\n    input  en_i,\n    input  serial_i,\n    output r_edge_o,\n    output f_edge_o,\n    output serial_o\n);\n\n    reg [STAGES-1:0] sync_reg;\n    reg [STAGES-1:0] sync_reg_d;\n    reg              serial_reg;\n    reg              serial_reg_d;\n\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni) begin\n            sync_reg <= {STAGES{1'b0}};\n        end else begin\n            sync_reg <= {sync_reg[STAGES-2:0], serial_i};\n        end\n    end\n\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni) begin\n            serial_reg <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            serial_reg <= sync_reg[STAGES-1];\n        end\n    end\n\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni) begin\n            serial_reg_d <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            serial_reg_d <= serial_reg;\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign serial_o = serial_reg;\n    assign r_edge_o = en_i & serial_reg & ~serial_reg_d;\n    assign f_edge_o = en_i & ~serial_reg & serial_reg_d;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
